komponenten-code-block-code-block.apiDescription:
## Inputs

```
export type CodeBlockComponentInputs = {
  /** Anzuzeigender Code (Klartext, `pre`-formatiert). */
  code: string;
  /**
   * Kopier-Button anzeigen (.cb-copy).
   *
   * @default true
   */
  copyable?: boolean;
  /**
   * Sprach-Label im Header (.cb-lang), rein informativ, ohne Syntax-Highlighting.
   *
   * @default HTML
   */
  lang?: string;
  /**
   * Terminal-Optik → .cb-terminal.
   *
   * @default false
   */
  terminal?: boolean;
}
```
